  <item>
    <title>职场算命还有SOP？花了几千块钱后我悟了</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/671ef8d5eb46cd665536c827</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">671ef8d5eb46cd665536c827</guid>
    <pubDate>Mon, 28 Oct 2024 02:37:09 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>关于算命，我的态度有180度大转变，从推崇相信到能不算就不算。特别是看过《了凡四训》后，时常想起“命由我作，福自己求”。年代久远的功过格不就是成长赛道博主们推崇的成功日记、失败日记、感恩日记变形吗！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="95">1:35</a> 算命sop总结下来就5步</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="209">3:29</a> 晋升季、大促季、绩效季是算命师傅的旺季</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="301">5:01</a> 你到底想算什么？需求描述要准确</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="392">6:32</a> 算命两大类：运势和选择，工具有侧重</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="579">9:39</a> 最好不要花钱自己学，特有毅力的除外</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="721">12:01</a> 跟算命师傅平等对话，不仰视不轻视</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="838">13:58</a> 命会越算越薄吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1050">17:30</a> 《了凡四训》“命由我作福自己求”</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1271">21:11</a> 拓展话题，聊聊功过格</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1397">23:17</a> 再拓展聊聊，寺庙的收入来源</span></p>]]></description>
    <enclosure url="https://media.xyzcdn.net/lssL5yxLL6eISxabyLeQBFTJTZSr.m4a" length="38794947" type="audio/mp4"/>
    <itunes:duration>00:26:44</itunes:duration>
    <itunes:image href="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FlcTHDGcFSlB4YGNBe1D76pFU51n.jpg"/>
    <itunes:explicit>false</itunes:explicit>
  </item>
  <item>
    <title>促销大混战，营销是傻蛋？从基本概念聊到消费分级</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/67163f9edb2cf82757d89f28</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">67163f9edb2cf82757d89f28</guid>
    <pubDate>Tue, 22 Oct 2024 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><span>天猫10.14就开始双十一了，商品主图买1送15密密麻麻全是赠品，打开app稍微晃动一下直达天猫，只想说一句：太癫了！促销的氛围太癫了！</span></p><span></span><p><span>这一期我们聊了以下话题：</span></p><span></span><p><span>商业分析的思考框架、营销促销推销的差异、商家为啥做消费者觉得莫名其妙的广告、从消费者视角出发的海盗模型、我们观察到的消费趋势......</span></p><span></span><p><span>希望对你有一些小启发~</span></p><span></span><p><span>本期节目时间轴：</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="121">2:01</a> 如果只推荐1个思考框架，我选how might we</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="286">4:46</a> 互动拆解卸妆油案例，提高方法论使用质量</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="640">10:40</a> 营销 促销 推销在搞啥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="821">13:41</a> 第一提及率，让用户记住你</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1034">17:14</a> 莫名其妙的广告，品牌真傻吗？</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1348">22:28</a> 少写一句话需求，减少垃圾广告</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1488">24:48</a> 海盗模型是个啥</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1917">31:57</a> 好家伙，你们都是欧莱雅的！</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2049">34:09</a> 消费降级和or升级？消费分级更恰当~</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="2351">39:11</a> 分享消费新趋势</span></p><span></span><p><span>来罐芝士是一档说人话的知识播客节目，我们围绕职场发展和商业创新输出内容，共建启发，以下是我们的播客内容大图，欢迎关注~</span></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FvTsQhQe94t0dV2VDcMXCipYd95n.png"></figure>]]></description>
